            <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-6 p-0 bg-secondary " id="a2" style="background-color:white!important">
              <div class="card card-body bg-none text-black py-3 border-0" style="background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0,0)!important">
                <h5>C. Do not enter buildings that have been hit by an earthquake</h5> 
                    <p id="">
Because there might still be ruins.</p>
              </div>
		   </div>
		   		 
</div>
 <div class="d-flex flex-row text-black align-items-stretch text-left" >
